understood that pass or that that rejection per se&nbsp;
because because it is a small film and it's about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:45.300
there's no explosions and there's no big special&nbsp;
effects or anything so it's not one of the five&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:53.880
Studio films that that a big Studio would make&nbsp;
but I I wanted to make this for myself just to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:59.820
just to get a story out there that I had&nbsp;
never seen before on screen do you see that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:06.120
ever though in the film industry or with with&nbsp;
film and TV writing screenwriting that there's&nbsp;&nbsp;

